      safety="The stone is palm-sized or bigger, smooth, washed, and checked before every session; anything cracked or sharp-edged leaves the set permanently. It travels low, lap to lap, in two hands, and is never tossed or handed over another child's head — the adult's hands shadow the pass for the youngest holders. The content rule is the record's other safety: only true, plain things are told — no invented ceremonies, no costumes, no 'playing' at being the people being honoured, ever; this record teaches about real neighbours with respect, and the adult corrects a drift toward pretend instantly and kindly.",
